[standards/technology/nodejs/STD-TEC-NODE-001-security.md#51-configuration-object-freezing]

### 5.1 Configuration Object Freezing

All configuration objects that are constructed at startup and consumed across the application **must** be frozen to prevent runtime mutation:

```typescript
const dbConfig = Object.freeze({
  host: process.env.DB_HOST ?? '',
  port: Number(process.env.DB_PORT ?? 5432),
  database: process.env.DB_NAME ?? '',
});
```

