[standards/technology/nodejs/STD-TEC-NODE-001-security.md#93-version-pinning]

### 9.3 Version Pinning

Floating version ranges are prohibited in the `dependencies` section of `package.json`. Exact versions must be used:

```json
{
  "dependencies": {
    "express": "4.19.2",
    "helmet": "7.1.0",
    "zod": "3.23.8",
    "pino": "9.3.2"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "typescript": "^5.5.0",
    "@types/express": "^4.17.21",
    "jest": "^29.7.0"
  }
}
```

- `^` and `~` are acceptable only in `devDependencies` because development tools do not ship in production containers.
- Use `npm install --save-exact` (`npm i -E`) when adding production dependencies.
